<PolicyPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  intro="How personal information should be handled across the website, booking, payment, email, analytics, and media providers."
  ><h2>Information you choose to provide</h2><p>
    Contact and newsletter forms may collect information you submit. Booking may require contact
    information, birth details, a time zone, an area of focus, accessibility needs, and acceptance
    of booking terms.
  </p><h2>Birth information</h2><p>
    Birth date, time, and location are sensitive personal information used to prepare astrological
    charts. They must not be stored in this website repository, analytics, browser storage, or URL
    parameters.
  </p><h2>Third parties</h2><p>
    Cloudflare may host the site; Cal.com may process scheduling and intake; Stripe may process
    payment; MailerLite may process optional marketing subscriptions; Google may process analytics
    only when enabled; YouTube and Instagram may process media interactions.
  </p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>
    Marketing consent is separate and optional. Final retention, deletion, access, and contact
    procedures require owner and professional review.
  </p></PolicyPage
>
